// Minimal initStream usage - receives a video stream from another
// hydra-rust instance running `examples/webrtc_broadcast.rs` and displays
// it directly. See README.md's "stream" section / DOCUMENTATION.md for
// how to start a broadcaster.
//
// Run: cargo run --features stream --bin hydra -- examples/stream_basic.hydra
// (edit the address below to match your broadcaster's IP:port first)

s0.initStream("127.0.0.1:9000").out()
